  "source_gate": "UR",
  "reason": "User requests bounded server exchange. Approved UR explicitly excludes automatic reconnection/restart and new orchestration store. Process-generation ownership and controlled retirement extend approved intent.",
  "intended_change": "Revise this same Run to include bounded, connection-owned server lifecycle: qualify new generation before new traffic, retain active views and in-flight decision identity on the original owner, retire oldest eligible idle generation with acknowledged close, and reject replacement at exhausted capacity. No process-age-only kill, cross-chat eviction, external process ownership, automatic business replay or inferred UI capability. Resolve Codex-host versus repository ownership in renewed Brownfield/PRD before implementation. See SERVER_LIFECYCLE_CHANGE_PROPOSAL.md for scope and tests.",
